# Hub domains (this repo)

## Allowed subscription URL (single path)

- `https://supone.top/clash/<token>`

Call-token exchange uses the **same host** (`/api/neurogate/call-token`).

## Forbidden

- Do **not** introduce other Hub hosts in docs, UI, code, or CI
- Do **not** reintroduce **phub** release-mirror / download-sync / `PHUB_*` secrets

This public client has **no** operational relationship with the old phub stack.
